  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "病院（談話室）",
    "id": "2026",
    "timezone": "4"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（うう～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（何なんだし、もったいつけちゃって……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（あたしだけ証明書の授与を後回しって、どういうこと？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（がう～っ、モヤモヤするし！　どういう意図があるしっ、嫌がらせ～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（たしかに、あたしはずっと不真面目な態度だったけど……。そんな意地悪される謂われはないし！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（あぁもうっ、あの黒髪のひとのいる病室に行きたくない～！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（でも。ししょ～は安静にしてないと駄目だし、腰を痛めてるから自分では動けないし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（あたしが運ぶしかないし、だから仕方ないし？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "「ししょ～……できるかぎり、ゆっくり丁寧に歩いてるつもりだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "「車椅子が揺れてオエッてなったり、腰が痛かったりしない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "「わわっ、頭を撫でないでほしいし！　照れるし～っ？　『大丈夫だよ』ってこと？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "「うが～！　ししょ～は態度だけじゃなくて、ちゃんと言葉で褒めてくれるべきだしっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "「ししょ～ったら、相変わらず変なひとだし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "「でも腰が痛くて弱ってるのに、誰かを褒めたりとか……。優しくできるのって、すごいことだと思うし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "「ししょ～、今日はお疲れさま。ゆっくり休んで、早く元気になってね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "「また、あたしに色んなことを教えてほしいし……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（ししょ～が安心して、身を任せてくれると、嬉しい。不思議な気分。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（ひとに優しくするって、『こういうこと』？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（あたし、いつも暴れたり噛みついたり……。自分のことばっかりで、ひとを傷つけてばっかりだし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（でも、これからはすこしでも誰かに優しくしてみるし？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（そう思えただけでも、この『職業体験』は収穫だったし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（あたしの人生にとって、有意義だったし？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（ししょ～が、みんなが、あたしに『優しさ』を分け与えてくれたし♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（あの黒髪のひとには……。素直に感謝しにくいけど、それでも）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 42,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いかり",
    "text": "（きちんとお礼を言って、証明書を受け取って、胸を張って堂々と帰るしっ♪）"
  }
